.TH "SOPLOS-REPO-SELECTOR" "1" "2026-11-17" "Soplos Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
soplos-repo-selector \- APT repository, mirror and signing key manager for Soplos Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B soplos-repo-selector
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B soplos-repo-selector
manages the APT software sources of Soplos Linux from a graphical interface.
Built with Tauri 2, Rust, and Svelte, it has three views:
.IP \[bu] 2
.B Repositories:
inspect, enable and disable every repository configured in
.I /etc/apt/sources.list
and in
.IR /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ ,
and convert the legacy one-line
.B .list
format to Debian's DEB822
.B .sources
format.
.IP \[bu]
.B Sources Generator:
switch mirrors, enable source code repositories and configure the non-free
components. It also runs a live mirror speed test: it streams real package
index downloads to measure the network throughput to each Debian mirror,
instead of measuring ping latency, and applies the fastest one.
.IP \[bu]
.B GPG Keys:
import, export, inspect and remove repository signing keys, with their
full fingerprint and expiry. A key that no configured repository references
any more, and that does not belong to an installed package, is flagged as
unused. Keyrings shipped by system packages are never flagged.
.P
The window never runs as root. Every change to the system goes through a single
Polkit-gated helper, authenticated with
.BR pkexec (1).
.P
The interface is available in English, Spanish, German, French, Italian,
Portuguese, Romanian and Russian. It starts in the system language and falls
back to English.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show summary of options.
.TP
.B \-\-run-privileged-script \fIFILE\fR
Internal Polkit-authenticated task: run the privileged script stored in
.IR FILE .
Used by the application itself through
.BR pkexec (1)
and not meant to be called by hand.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B F1
About dialog.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit the application.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Tab
Next section.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+Tab
Previous section.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/apt/sources.list
Main APT repository configuration file.
.TP
.I /etc/apt/sources.list.d/
Directory of modular repository files, in
.B .sources
and
.B .list
format.
.TP
.I /etc/apt/keyrings/
Location of the repository signing keys. Created by the program when missing.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.soplos.reposelector.policy
Polkit policy defining the administrator privileges for changes to the sources and keys.
